// # app/actor — OTP-Style Concurrency
//
// Logline: Actor-based concurrency (spawn, send, recv, restart), channels, joinable pthread-backed threads, and closures. The oodar-native execution model.
//
// Beats:
//   1. thread.h — the OoThreadSlot type.
//   2. thread.c — the joinable pthread slot table.
//   3. actor.c — the OTP-style actor (spawn/send/recv/destroy).
//   4. channel.c — the typed message channel.
//   5. closure.h, closure.c — the OoClosure type + capture/dispatch.
//
// ──▓▓ app/actor ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: OTP-style — supervise, restart, no shared state ::
